Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] Native title canvas: original logo from runtime sprites

Keep the original title sprites and their animation while they enter. On the
stable title state, upload the original sprites (US, or the EU bank of the
current LANGUAGE, including the Alt layout of language 0) into a private RGBA
texture, resample the logo with Lanczos2, and hide only the duplicate native
logo/menu draws; US also hides its footer, while EU keeps its own credit
sprites. Built with DW3_TITLE_NATIVE_OVERLAY (PC SDL3 GPU and the Switch game
image); SDL3 GL keeps its original path. The edge fade reports its level so
the overlay darkens with it; each title visit resets it.

